sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Coordinator
  participant P1 as Inventory
  participant P2 as Payment
  participant P3 as Workflow store
  P0->>P3: Persist workflow start
  P0->>P1: Reserve with operation ID
  P1->>P0: Reservation confirmed
  P0->>P2: Attempt payment
  P2-->>P0: Known decline
  P0->>P3: Persist compensation intent
  P0->>P1: Release reservation idempotently
  P1->>P0: Release confirmed
  P0->>P3: Persist rejected terminal state
